      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Reverse-Proxy (nginx)\n- Resolver (unbound)\n\n- Cache (harmonia, nix-daemon)\n\n- Distributed Authoring and Versioning (davis)\n- E-Mail (dovecot, postfix)\n- Sharing (samba, nfs)\n- Monitoring (alloy, grafana, loki, mimir, etc.)\n- Application Sync (anki-sync, firefox-sync)",
